# Private signing keys must NEVER be committed — this repository is public and
# the key is a fleet-wide credential.
#
# Public keys are not kept as loose files here either. They live in the
# JB_HEALTH_SIGNING_PUBKEYS array in jb-site-health.php, which is the single
# source of truth for what this plugin will accept. A second copy on disk only
# drifts, and then it is not obvious which one is actually in force.
*.key
*.pem

.DS_Store
